  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strenghtening Equity, Access and Quality in Education 2 (SEAQE2)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Learners in South and Central states of Somalia will access, engage and learn in inclusive primary education.  SEAQE2 will develop education pathways for marginalised children including out-of-school children, children with disabilities and IDPs. Our learner-focused approach, concentrates on quality, equity, inclusion, protection and participation.</narrative>
  </description>
